              "text": "Personal and business credit context—discuss carefully; no DIY credit-repair claims.",
              "reviewFlags": [
                "credit",
                "financing"
              ],
              "sourceNeeded": true
            },
            {
              "text": "Collateral, guarantees, and covenants—questions for the lender and your advisor.",
              "reviewFlags": [
                "financing",
                "legal"
              ],
              "sourceNeeded": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "gaps",
          "heading": "Common gaps to close before a meeting",
